Package: ultrapkg
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, dpkg, coreutils, imagemagick
Description: Lightweight GPL package installer and .deb thumbnail helper for flax.system
 Ultrapkg is a clean, modular package utility for local .deb files and desktop
 integration. It follows the Flax system philosophy: simple, stable, and easy
 to maintain.
